# Clean State Checklist — {{PROJECT_TITLE}}

Gates referenced from `.harness/gates.yml`. Every AI session and every
pull request must clear the relevant block.

---

## start-of-session

- [ ] Read `AGENTS.md`
- [ ] Read `docs/00-project-control/current-state.yml`
- [ ] Read `docs/00-project-control/active-work.md`
- [ ] Read active task file (if any)
- [ ] Confirm no uncommitted changes from a previous session are stranded
- [ ] Confirm working branch matches `current-state.yml.current.active_branch`

---

## before-development

- [ ] Feature status is `accepted` or later
- [ ] User story links to an accepted feature and a source requirement
- [ ] Acceptance criteria exist
- [ ] Product Requirement maturity ≥ `draft`
- [ ] Solution Architecture maturity ≥ `draft`
- [ ] Blocking open questions are recorded in `open-question-log.md`
- [ ] No development is starting from a `proposed` feature

---

## pre-pr

- [ ] Impacted Documents in the task file are updated
- [ ] Technical Design ≥ `draft` if technical behavior changed
- [ ] API Contract updated if API changed
- [ ] Data Model updated if schema changed
- [ ] Security & Authorization updated if access changed
- [ ] Release Notes updated if user-facing behavior changed
- [ ] Document Completion Matrix reflects current state

---

## pre-release

- [ ] All mandatory documents reach maturity required by
      `.harness/document-fulfillment.yml`
- [ ] Document Completion Matrix is current
- [ ] Release Notes maturity is `accepted`
- [ ] Deployment Guide maturity is `accepted`
- [ ] Runbook maturity ≥ `draft`
- [ ] Known issues are documented
- [ ] Published package is prepared under `docs/99-published/`
- [ ] Reliability document is updated
- [ ] Golden journeys are defined
- [ ] Health-check / verification procedure is documented

---

## pre-handover

- [ ] User Guide maturity is `accepted`
- [ ] Admin Guide maturity is `accepted` (if applicable)
- [ ] Runbook maturity is `accepted`
- [ ] Troubleshooting Guide maturity is `accepted`
- [ ] Final Handover Checklist is completed

---

## end-of-session

- [ ] `latest-session.md` updated
- [ ] `active-work.md` updated
- [ ] `progress-log.md` updated with today's entry
- [ ] `document-completion-matrix.md` updated
- [ ] `current-state.yml` updated
- [ ] No fabricated content was added (anti-fiction check)
